  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Access to Safe and Dignified (WASH) Assistance in Communities in Mangu LGA, Plateau State.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide clean water access, enhance sanitation facilities, and promote hygiene practices, directly addressing these pressing concerns. Furthermore, it seeks to foster unity and peace in a region marked by diversity. In the conflict-affected communities of Bungha and Pushit, the need for improved WASH infrastructure and practices is critical to enhance access to WASH services and the well-being of the community, thereby contributing to positive behavioral change and improving the protection environment and reduction in general mortality rates related to water-borne diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
